<title>USA: Griffon Corp arm gets $100 mln UK contract.</title>
<headline>Griffon Corp arm gets $100 mln UK contract.</headline>
<dateline>JERICHO, N.Y. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffon Corp said Friday that its Telephonic Corp subsidiary has won a contract valued at more than $100 million from British Aerospace (Operations) Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said the contract was the largest in its history.</p>
<p>The contract calls for Telephonic Corp to provide communications systems for the Royal Air Force NIMROD 2000 Maritime Patrol Aircraft Program as a subcontractor to British Aerospace.</p>
</text>
